  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c641f0240fccdbf4e8d5617e34811eb8, type: 3}
  m_Name: F_LustDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueContainerWithModels
  speakerIds: []
  speakerPrefabs: []
  nodes:
  - nodeId: 0
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: You're consumed by <anim:wave>lust<anim:none>, aren't you?
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
    spriteAtlas: []
    spriteId: 0
    _speakerVoiceClips: []
    material: {fileID: 0}
    onNodeStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onNodeEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - nodeId: 1
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: Across the fallen leaves of the autumn park, you followed the echo of her
      voice without ever knowing her name.
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
    spriteAtlas: []
    spriteId: 0
    _speakerVoiceClips: []
    material: {fileID: 0}
    onNodeStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onNodeEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - nodeId: 2
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: Silken hair and the graceful curve of her body drew your mortal flesh toward
      hers.
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
    spriteAtlas: []
    spriteId: 0
    _speakerVoiceClips: []
    material: {fileID: 0}
    onNodeStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onNodeEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - nodeId: 3
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: You let every stop where the sunsets were at their most beautiful slip
      past, unwilling to lose the rhythm of her footsteps.
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
    spriteAtlas: []
    spriteId: 0
    _speakerVoiceClips: []
    material: {fileID: 0}
    onNodeStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onNodeEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - nodeId: 4
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: You kept following until she turned onto a path you had never walked before.
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
    spriteAtlas: []
    spriteId: 0
    _speakerVoiceClips: []
    material: {fileID: 0}
    onNodeStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onNodeEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - nodeId: 5
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: "Watching her disappear with a hungry, slavering gaze, you turned your
      flesh\u2014and your legs, slick with clammy sweat\u2014toward another enticing
      scent, in search of yet another pair of eyes."
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
    spriteAtlas: []
    spriteId: 0
    _speakerVoiceClips: []
    material: {fileID: 0}
    onNodeStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onNodeEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - nodeId: 6
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: So... your memories are coming back to you now, aren't they?
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
    spriteAtlas: []
    spriteId: 0
    _speakerVoiceClips: []
    material: {fileID: 0}
    onNodeStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onNodeEnd:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - nodeId: 7
    speakerId: 
    initialized: 0
    speakerIsThis: 0
    overWriteValues: 0
    text: Choose your five. The rest are already gone.
    initFromScriptableObject: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerGameObject: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    useSpriteAtlas: 0
